Carmen Cruickshank: No.

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:58.000
Carmen Cruickshank: My questions were kind of — yeah, I was like — I was too — it was a little like — no, anyway. Thank you, Giselle.

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:54.000
